WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.286
"Oh no!" Wukong looked at the fan.

2
00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:09.477
[g@"This fan doesn't work!

3
00:00:09.478 --> 00:00:13.110
The Iron Immortal must have tricked me."@g]

4
00:00:13.111 --> 00:00:17.538
The travelers backed away as the fire burned hotter.

5
00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:20.274
[g@"What will we do?" asked the Tang Monk.

6
00:00:20.275 --> 00:00:23.023
"We can't go through that fire."@g]

7
00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:25.026
[g@Bajie threw his hands up.

8
00:00:25.027 --> 00:00:27.189
"Let's just go home.@g]

9
00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:30.837
We'll write a letter to Buddha explaining what happened."

10
00:00:30.838 --> 00:00:35.344
"Bajie, we can't do that!" the Tang Monk scolded.

11
00:00:35.345 --> 00:00:37.192
Wukong spoke up.

12
00:00:37.193 --> 00:00:41.400
"I used to be friends with the Iron Immortal's husband, the Bull Demon King.

13
00:00:41.401 --> 00:00:44.787
I have an idea."

14
00:00:44.788 --> 00:00:49.199
The Iron Immortal was in her cave when she heard a knock.

15
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:56.656
"Oh no," she said to herself. "That monkey is back."

16
00:00:56.657 --> 00:01:02.006
She walked quietly to the door and peeked outside.

17
00:01:02.007 --> 00:01:08.031
When she saw the Bull Demon King, she smiled and opened the door.

18
00:01:08.032 --> 00:01:11.317
[g@"I'm glad you're back," said the Iron Immortal.

19
00:01:11.318 --> 00:01:14.366
"Sun Wukong was here."@g]

20
00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:16.306
[g@"I used to be friends with him."

21
00:01:16.307 --> 00:01:18.157
The demon smiled.@g]

22
00:01:18.158 --> 00:01:21.992
"It would have been nice to see him again."

23
00:01:21.993 --> 00:01:24.059
His wife was confused.

24
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:25.830
[g@"What do you mean?

25
00:01:25.831 --> 00:01:29.556
You told me that you never really liked him."@g]

26
00:01:29.557 --> 00:01:32.915
"Oh, really?" said the demon.

27
00:01:32.916 --> 00:01:36.161
[g@"He was very rude," said the woman.

28
00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:39.638
"He demanded I let him borrow my fan."@g]

29
00:01:39.639 --> 00:01:43.955
"You didn't give it to him, did you?" asked the demon.

30
00:01:43.956 --> 00:01:46.764
"Of course not," said his wife.

31
00:01:46.765 --> 00:01:52.606
"I gave him a fake fan that looks just like the real one."

32
00:01:52.607 --> 00:01:57.493
[g@The demon began pacing.

33
00:01:57.494 --> 00:02:02.918
"Wukong is very smart and very powerful," he said.@g]

34
00:02:02.919 --> 00:02:06.821
"He'll realize you tricked him, and then he'll come back here."

35
00:02:06.822 --> 00:02:10.090
"What should we do?" asked the Iron Immortal.

36
00:02:10.091 --> 00:02:12.795
[g@"Give me the fan," said the demon.

37
00:02:12.796 --> 00:02:17.635
"I'll keep it safe."@g]

38
00:02:17.636 --> 00:02:26.792
The Iron Immortal opened a chest and took out the fan.

39
00:02:26.793 --> 00:02:29.893
She handed it to her husband.

40
00:02:29.894 --> 00:02:35.840
Suddenly light sparkled and Wukong stood in front of her.

41
00:02:35.841 --> 00:02:38.650
[g@"I tricked you!"

42
00:02:38.651 --> 00:02:43.571
The monkey laughed and ran out of the cave.@g]

43
00:02:43.572 --> 00:02:48.423
The Iron Immortal stamped her foot. "Ugh!"

44
00:02:48.424 --> 00:02:52.176
She was still angry when her husband came home.

45
00:02:52.177 --> 00:02:56.612
"Hello, dear," said the Bull Demon King with a big smile.

46
00:02:56.613 --> 00:03:00.280
But then his smile faded. "What's wrong?"

47
00:03:00.281 --> 00:03:04.379
"Your friend Sun Wukong was here!" she snapped.

48
00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:07.389
"He's not my friend!" said the demon.

49
00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:12.182
"Even before he defeated Red Boy, I never really liked him."

50
00:03:12.183 --> 00:03:16.628
"Well, you'll like him even less now," said the Iron Immortal.

51
00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:19.177
"He stole my fan!"

52
00:03:19.178 --> 00:03:21.360
The demon looked surprised.

53
00:03:21.361 --> 00:03:24.883
[g@"That fan's wind magic is powerful.

54
00:03:24.884 --> 00:03:27.414
How did the monkey steal it?"@g]

55
00:03:27.415 --> 00:03:31.156
"He tricked me into giving it to him," said his wife.

56
00:03:31.157 --> 00:03:33.928
"He made himself look like you."

57
00:03:33.929 --> 00:03:35.898
[g@The demon's face turned red.

58
00:03:35.899 --> 00:03:37.920
"How dare he do that!"

59
00:03:37.921 --> 00:03:39.819
He took a deep breath.@g]

60
00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:43.812
[g@"Don't worry. I will find that rotten monkey.

61
00:03:43.813 --> 00:03:47.286
I'll get your fan back!"@g]

62
00:03:47.287 --> 00:03:52.366
The Bull Demon King stomped out of the cave.

63
00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:56.906
Wukong walked along the road, carrying the plantain-leaf fan.

64
00:03:56.907 --> 00:04:01.160
He was still laughing about how he'd tricked the Iron Immortal.

65
00:04:01.161 --> 00:04:04.138
Then he saw Bajie approaching.

66
00:04:04.139 --> 00:04:09.728
"Bajie!" cried Wukong. "What are you doing here?"

67
00:04:09.729 --> 00:04:13.203
"I was coming to help you," said the pig.

68
00:04:13.204 --> 00:04:16.038
[g@"Thanks, but I don't need help."

69
00:04:16.039 --> 00:04:18.030
Wukong held up the fan.@g]

70
00:04:18.031 --> 00:04:22.221
"I tricked the Iron Immortal and got the real fan this time."

71
00:04:22.222 --> 00:04:26.110
"Good!" said Bajie. "I can carry it for you."

72
00:04:26.111 --> 00:04:30.494
"Thanks," said Wukong as he handed the fan to Bajie.

73
00:04:30.495 --> 00:04:33.741
The monkey patted his friend on the shoulder.

74
00:04:33.742 --> 00:04:36.785
"Now let's get back to Master. We need to—"

75
00:04:36.786 --> 00:04:39.460
Suddenly there was a flash of light.

76
00:04:39.461 --> 00:04:44.461
A second later the Bull Demon King stood next to Wukong.

77
00:04:44.462 --> 00:04:46.591
[g@The demon laughed.

78
00:04:46.592 --> 00:04:49.755
"I tricked you, Wukong!"@g]

79
00:04:49.756 --> 00:04:57.864
There was another flash and the demon was gone.

